{"type":"thought","data":" a `.done` marker is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" removed. For a distinct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" report, the marker "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is never stripped during"}
{"type":"thought","data":" collection. This means"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an existing marker "}
{"type":"thought","data":"on a byte-identical "}
{"type":"thought","data":"report would persist"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on the copied file."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan assumes audit-cycle"}
{"type":"thought","data":" callers are already"}
