{"type":"thought","data":"The implementation already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exists in the tree."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Tests, TRANSPORT_RE,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" collect, and mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec shape tests are"}
{"type":"thought","data":" all present."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThis is an audit of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the PLAN document, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"not a greenfield plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will check the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for consistency with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design and verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" its claims about the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree. The role is adversarial_consistency."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will verify the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan's specific claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" codebase. Findings "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will focus on the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document and its alignment"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the design, not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on implementation bugs."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan v1.13 claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that `test_mutation_spec_shape`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not yet exist,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the function is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" already present in "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the tree. This suggests"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan's claims are"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stale or outdated."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan is a living"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document. Version history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shows it was updated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" during implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as tasks were executed."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The audit should evaluate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan's current "}
{"type":"thought","data":"state rather than assume"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it was written before"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the code existed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit should focus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on contradictions that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" remain in the plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"itself, not merely outdated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" version history notes."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The requirement that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Task 6 creates `test_mutation_spec_shape`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is still valid for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"an executed plan. I "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will now read the implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan carefully and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"compare it against the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design and code."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI am checking specific"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims in the plan."}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-6.3 lists 24 mutations"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but the code may only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" have 23. AC-3.1 says"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit 1 but the code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" returns 2. I am also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verifying that `_VERSION_RE`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" matches the required"}
{"type":"thought","data":" filename patterns."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe regex matches "}
{"type":"thought","data":"audit filenames with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" hyphenated features"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and optional dotted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suffixes. I am now "}
{"type":"thought","data":"checking whether `.p<i>.md`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" filenames satisfy the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `.p<i>.md` suffixes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are patterns to cover,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not literal filenames."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A bare `foo.p1.md` "}
{"type":"thought","data":"without a version prefix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would fail the `_VERSION_RE`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check. Every audit_doc"}
{"type":"thought","data":" entry must be a full"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name that matches the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regex."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `.codex_draft.md`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suffix also satisfies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `_VERSION_RE`. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`audit_f.plan.audit.v8.codex.md`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" filename matches the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" regex via search, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `TRANSPORT_RE` would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reject it because it"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not end with `.report.md`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI am examining the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" distinction between"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `re.match` and `re.search`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for `_VERSION_RE`. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The regex lacks a leading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" caret, so `.match` "}
{"type":"thought","data":"would fail on filenames"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that do not begin with"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.v`. The code uses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.search`, which succeeds."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I am checking whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan's claim that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `_collected_path(...).name`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"matches\" the regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is accurate under this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" behavior."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's claim that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `_collected_path(...).name`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"matches\" `_VERSION_RE`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is ambiguous. Python's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `re.match()` requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a leading caret, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the regex lacks one,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so it would fail on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" every collected path."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The codebase uses `.search()`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" instead. If an implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" follows the plan literally"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and writes `.match()`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-1.6 becomes impossible"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to satisfy."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will read the existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test `test_collected_path_names_match_audit_doc_grammar_not_transport`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify how `_VERSION_RE`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is actually used in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code. I am also checking"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether `f.impl-plan.audit.v8.codex.md`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" satisfies the regex."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe regex only permits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one optional dotted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" token after the version"}
{"type":"thought","data":" number. A filename "}
{"type":"thought","data":"like `f.plan.audit.v8.codex.extra.md`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would fail because "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`.extra.md` cannot match"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the required `.md` "}
{"type":"thought","data":"suffix."}
