{"type":"thought","data":"The code already returns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2 for transport refusal."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-3.1 requires exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 1, contradicting the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" existing code and test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that expect exit 2."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a must-fix "}
{"type":"thought","data":"defect in the implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan. The test's return"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code assertion needs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verification."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" also specifies return"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2 for transport refusal,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not exit 1. The mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec actual count needs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verification. A stale"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim in version history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" incorrectly states "}
{"type":"thought","data":"that test_mutation_spec_shape"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not exist."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe stale version "}
{"type":"thought","data":"history note is a point-in-time"}
{"type":"thought","data":" record from when v1.13"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was authored, not a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" defect in the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree. It classifies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a measurement nit."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan header claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it tracks the design's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" newest version history"}
{"type":"thought","data":" entry. I will compare"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the design file's version"}
{"type":"thought","data":" history against the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan's claims to find"}
{"type":"thought","data":" any incorrect assertions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" about the current tree."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-6.3 lists 24 mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" specs instead of 23."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's regex requirement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is ambiguous: it says"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"matches\" but existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tests use `.search()`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is not a plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"bug because the code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" already implements "}
{"type":"thought","data":"search."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's \"matches\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" wording is ambiguous."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It does not specify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `.search()` versus "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`.match()`, and the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"regex is unanchored "}
{"type":"thought","data":"by design. This should"}
{"type":"thought","data":" be a should-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will verify the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"design document for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"an exit-1 requirement."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I also need to check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the harness output "}
{"type":"thought","data":"format, SKILL.md section"}
{"type":"thought","data":" placement, line number"}
{"type":"thought","data":" citations in the design,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the PassSpec and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" collect signatures "}
{"type":"thought","data":"against the plan. I "}
{"type":"thought","data":"should compare gate()"}
{"type":"thought","data":" return-code acceptance"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the plan's "}
{"type":"thought","data":"exit-1 requirement. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Any CLI structure divergences"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between collect-report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the plan will be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" noted.\n\nI will scan the implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan and code in parallel"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for contradictions."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I also need to verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether the design "}
{"type":"thought","data":"requires SKILL.md edits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to be additive within"}
{"type":"thought","data":" existing sections or"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to create new ones,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and whether audit_dirs"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is configured for the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" impl-plan phase."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI am checking that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" every test name in "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the plan table actually"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exists. I also need"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify the harness"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unreadable= field, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the AC-2.12 readback"}
{"type":"thought","data":" message, and whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" SystemExit is used "}
{"type":"thought","data":"instead of help. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mutation count of 24"}
{"type":"thought","data":" may be a typo introduced"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in a later edit. I "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will inspect the design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file for exit codes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and mutation counts."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I am also reviewing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" project invariants "}
{"type":"thought","data":"for breaches. Some design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumption entries "}
{"type":"thought","data":"cite a verification "}
{"type":"thought","data":"date but omit the exact"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command; the plan similarly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omits commands for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"harness unreadable= "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and multiline helper.\n\nThe missing command"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for the harness unreadable="}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumption breaches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a base invariant. Behavioural"}
{"type":"thought","data":" premises must carry"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the exact command inline,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and omitting it is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a must-fix violation.\n\nThe plan omits the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exact command for both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the multiline helper"}
{"type":"thought","data":" refusal and the harness"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unreadable= assumption."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This confirms the must-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" breach."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nMore design assumptions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omit exact commands."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The harness treats "}
{"type":"thought","data":"`test` as optional and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" never reads `_mechanism`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" `GATING_MUTATION_SPEC`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and `CONNECTIONS_MUTATION_SPEC`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are verified by date"}
{"type":"thought","data":" alone. v1.13 cites "}
{"type":"thought","data":"grep without the full"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command. Auditing every"}
{"type":"thought","data":" missing command across"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ten gated cycles would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" flood the report."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will sweep the entire"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document for base invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" violations. A missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command is a document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" defect even if the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"underlying premise is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" true. I am now re-verifying"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the harness output,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" version history helper,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate exit codes, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test names."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will prioritize "}
{"type":"thought","data":"flagging false or misleading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" premises over every"}
{"type":"thought","data":" missing command. The invariant is binding,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but past audits focused"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on correcting actual"}
{"type":"thought","data":" errors rather than "}
{"type":"thought","data":"demanding commands on"}
{"type":"thought","data":" every sentence. I am"}
{"type":"thought","data":" now running commands"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to verify the load-bearing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumptions."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe base invariant"}
{"type":"thought","data":" forbids downgrading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" any violation to should-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Missing commands therefore"}
{"type":"thought","data":" qualify as must-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Reporting every missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" command would be technically"}
{"type":"thought","data":" correct but excessive."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Earlier cycles accepted"}
{"type":"thought","data":" date-only verification"}
{"type":"thought","data":" notes as sufficient"}
{"type":"thought","data":" evidence."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nRequiring exact commands"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for every assumption"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would reverse the prior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" agreement on evidence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" style. The audit will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" focus on provable contradictions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and false claims. Signal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" discipline is breached:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-3.1 demands exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 1 for INVALID, yet "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the invariant restricts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" non-zero exits to operational"}
{"type":"thought","data":" errors. The existing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code returns 2 for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"missing gate sections,"}
