{"type":"thought","data":"I am reading the e′ "}
{"type":"thought","data":"mutation entry in the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" JSON to identify its"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test. I will also mentally"}
{"type":"thought","data":" simulate whether the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mutant survives."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe e′ mutation replaces"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the `is_dir()` guard"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with `False`. The named"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test uses a file as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the project root. Without"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the guard, `_collected_path`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" joins that file path"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with a hardcoded subdirectory."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I need to check the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cycle default."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe simulation confirms"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the mutant survives."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A file project root"}
{"type":"thought","data":" joined with a hardcoded"}
{"type":"thought","data":" subdirectory raises"}
{"type":"thought","data":" NotADirectoryError."}
{"type":"thought","data":" That exception is caught"}
{"type":"thought","data":" by the main handler,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the test passes."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The mutation does not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" affect the features-path-is-file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" case because the project"}
{"type":"thought","data":" root is already a directory."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe readonly and usage"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cases also pass. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" named test remains "}
{"type":"thought","data":"green. The plan incorrectly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims this test kills"}
{"type":"thought","data":" e′; it actually describes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a different observable."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe design document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" repeats the same incorrect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim about e′, omitting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the test function name."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will quote the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table row rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the JSON. I am also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" scanning other rows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for similar issues."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's Task 6 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"description claims the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" observable is MISSING/exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0, but the table points"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to a test that cannot"}
{"type":"thought","data":" produce that result."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The usage test covers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-2.10 by passing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a file as `--project-root`."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-2.10 does not explicitly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" require that an absent"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `--project-root` must"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not trigger a `mkdir`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design step 1 covers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this case. A second"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must-fix may be needed:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" AC-2.10 omits the absent-root"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fixture, so an implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" following only that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement could write"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a file-root test and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" ship an unkillable "}
{"type":"thought","data":"e′."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's own observable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and its named test "}
{"type":"thought","data":"disagree. The plan claims"}
{"type":"thought","data":" MISSING, but a file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" root cannot produce"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that result.\n\nAC-3.1"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exit 1 is the second"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must-fix.\n\nI will check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether the JSON already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" points to the absent-root"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test while the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" still names the old"}
{"type":"thought","data":" one. This would confirm"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan is stale."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI am checking the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan for additional "}
{"type":"thought","data":"bugs. Task 6 lists AC-6.3"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as \"24\". The harness"}
{"type":"thought","data":" output prefix and install_audit_stub_harness"}
{"type":"thought","data":" need review. The design"}
{"type":"thought","data":" document is embedded"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inside an existing "}
{"type":"thought","data":"section. The CollectConflict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" message is acceptable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" because the code already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implements it. The plan allows extra detail"}
{"type":"thought","data":" lines in markers, so the code's missing_diagnosis output is not a violation.\n\nI am checking whether the literal report path from SKILL 6.6 still exists in SKILL.md and whether the codex form is present in the new section."}
